 operations makes ${a}_{31}=0?$" :question/worked-solution "Of the given options, we consider the row operation \n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1}.\n$$\n\nApplying the above row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-3)\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-3){R}_{1}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186341880 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01aa7eac-2d1b-5e7c-81d8-ff9b3598042f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339145} {:answer/id #uuid "458eeb48-644b-5aa1-9b8a-2beaa389cd3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:=(-1){R}_{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339744} {:answer/id #uuid "5ab34af4-6674-54fa-8f42-65b3801eff6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339953} {:answer/id #uuid "9122ba5d-cc5d-5263-8a7e-05f1f3746bfe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340431} {:answer/id #uuid "f881cda1-e586-5ced-a9a8-39ea1a47c5ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}↔{R}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341327}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5ab34af4-6674-54fa-8f42-65b3801eff6a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339953} :answer-field/id #uuid "ef2e4b02-8def-5910-b9cb-c64b8d3a1992" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341809}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "4620d00b-e63c-5bb6-90cb-233c01e9e5ab" :question/math-academy-id "q-72857" :question/problem "Given that\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & \\,-4 & \\,\\,-2 \\\\ 0 & \\,-1 & \\,4 \\\\ 2 & \\,2 & \\,1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$,\nwhich of the following elementary row operations makes ${a}_{33}=0?$" :question/worked-solution "Of the given options, we consider the row operation    \n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1}.\n$$\n\nApplying the above row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & \\,-4 & \\,\\,-2 \\\\ 0 & \\,-1 & \\,4 \\\\ 2 & \\,2 & \\,1\\end{bmatrix}\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}2 & \\,-4 & \\,\\,-2 \\\\ 0 & \\,-1 & \\,4 \\\\ 3 & \\,0 & \\,0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the required row operation is\n\n$$\n{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186341881 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44ff5f78-99ee-52f3-bd1d-6f04102d7f6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-3{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339741} {:answer/id #uuid "64bc7a5d-f05c-508b-8e6f-0c816e66dd68" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}↔{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340019} {:answer/id #uuid "66d5039f-7e91-5441-b9ac-066a1add60d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}↔{R}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340032} {:answer/id #uuid "6efcee92-7f3a-5b03-8419-b8d8e7b73d4d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-2{R}_{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340112} {:answer/id #uuid "98eddd1d-580c-5f43-aabf-9b49e45c9fcb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340508}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "44ff5f78-99ee-52f3-bd1d-6f04102d7f6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-3{R}_{1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339741} :answer-field/id #uuid "51eb3628-ef5f-5e6a-a72e-2